  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br>Step inside to discover SeaRenity, a haven of comfort and luxury. Four of the bedrooms boast king beds and en-suite bathrooms, ensuring a restful retreat for everyone. The fifth bedroom, a bunkroom that can sleep 10. Escape to your own piece of paradise at our stunning beach house in Seacrest Beach, nestled along the enchanting 30A near Rosemary Beach. This captivating 5-bedroom home is located within a secure gated community, offering both privacy and convenience and sleeps 16!<br><br>The Space:<br>Embrace the coastal lifestyle with the beach just a leisurely stroll away, inviting you to soak in the sun and dip into the refreshing waves. Explore the vibrant neighborhood, with an array of restaurants and shopping options within walking distance, catering to every palate and style.<br><br>For moments of relaxation and enjoyment right at your doorstep, take advantage of the pool located just across the street. Bask in the warm sun, take a refreshing swim, or unwind with a poolside cocktail.<br><br>Whether you seek a peaceful escape or a lively beachside adventure, our beach house in Seacrest offers the ideal setting for creating cherished memories with your loved ones. Book your stay now and let the sun, sand, and sea weave their magic on your vacation.<br><br>The first floor offers a gathering place with a living room, dining area, kitchen, and powder room. <br><br>ABOUT THE AREA: Conveniently located between Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach, it’s the perfect blend of privacy while still near all that 30A has to offer. As guests, you’ll have access to the private Seacrest Beach and use of the free tram service that runs from 9am to 6pm, March through October. <br><br>BEACH ACCESS: Seacrest Beach Private Beach Access. Closest public beach is Inlet Regional Beach Access<br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS: Sleeps 18<br>• Bedroom 1 – King, ensuite (2nd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 2 – King, ensuite (2nd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 3 – King, ensuite (2nd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 4 – King, ensuite (3rd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 5 – Bunk room, ensuite (2) Queen/Queen and a Twin/Twin (sleeps 10) (3rd Floor)<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>• Outdoor Grill<br>• 4 Adult Bikes<br>• Community Pool<br>• Outdoor deck with seating<br>• TV’s through out<br>• Media room on third floor<br>• Washer & Dryer<br>• Self-Check-In<br>• Coffee pot – Drip & Keurig<br>• Full linen package: bedding & bath towels, wash clothes<br>• Starter kit: toilet paper, paper towels, dishwasher and washing machine pods, trash bags, kitchen towels, hand soap, bar of soap for shower <br>• Fully stocked kitchen<br>• Dedicated workspace<br>• Outdoor shower<br>• Access to Seacrest Beach (private beach)<br>• Private tram service (March–October, 9am–6pm) - pick up at the home<br><br><br>PARKING: Enjoy the convenience of 2 designated parking spots outside, and one small to medium sized vehicle can fit in the garage. Additionally, we've secured overflow parking just under a mile away for your convenience.<br><br>Book Your Stay: <br>Unlock a memorable and stress-free vacation by reserving your spot at our enchanting property. Experience the allure of SeaRenity, a 5-bedroom haven located on Highway 30A. With 6 bathrooms, parking for up to 3 vehicles. Comfortably accommodating up to 18 guests, it's the perfect setting for your getaway. Feel free to reach out with any questions or special requests. <br><br>Your escape to 30A awaits - secure your dates today!<br><br>ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>- Must be 25 years old to book and stay at the property during entire reservation period<br>- No pets<br>- Just a quick heads-up: once you book we'll be using our nifty guest messaging platform for all our chit-chats, so keep an eye on your text for messages from our 850 phone number. Additionally, before the fun begins, we'll need you to sign our rental agreement that has a $100 authorization hold for incidentals. It's all part of the check-in charm! Thanks for being awesome!<br><br>Guest Access:<br>When you choose SeaRenity for your vacation, you gain exclusive access to the entire residence, ensuring a private and comfortable retreat for you and your guests.<br><br>Getting Around:<br>Walk 50 steps from your front door and hop on the beach tram that will take you right to the private beach access!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
